 apply tendsto_pi_nhds.mpr; intro i; change Tendsto (fun i' => Wick.apex i+6*WishGap_S P i') atTop (𝓝 (Wick.apex i)); simpa only [mul_zero,add_zero] using ((wish0_S P).const_mul (6:ℝ)).const_add (Wick.apex i)
